          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವಯಸ್ಕ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಯಸ್ಕ — vayaska — \"an adult\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹದಿನೆಂಟು ವರ್ಷದ ನಂತರ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ವಯಸ್ಕರು ಆಗುತ್ತಾರೆ. hadineṇṭu varṣada nantara makkaḷu vayaskaru āguttāre. After eighteen, children become adults."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ವಯಸ್ಕರು, vayaskaru."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on ವಯಸ್ಸು, age."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಯಸ್ಕ (vayaska) is built on Sanskrit vayas, \"age, vigour of life\", which Monier-Williams also lists in compounds with -vayaska (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
