          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹದಿಹರೆಯ — hadihareya — \"the teenage years\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹದಿಹರೆಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಮಕ್ಕಳ ಸ್ವಭಾವ ಬದಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ. hadihareyadalli makkaḷa svabhāva badalāguttade. Children's nature changes in the teenage years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹದಿ- is the \"-teen\" of ಹದಿನಾರು, sixteen; ಹರೆಯ is youth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹದಿಹರೆಯ (hadihareya) is a Kannada compound of hadi-, the \"ten\" in ಹದಿನಾರು (DEDR 3918 lists Kannada padi-, ten, in compounds), and hareya, \"youth\"; the origin of hareya is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
