              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಏಕಾಂತ — ēkānta — \"solitude\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಯಸ್ಸಾದ ಮೇಲೆ ಅಜ್ಜನಿಗೆ ಏಕಾಂತ ಇಷ್ಟ. vayassāda mēle ajjanige ēkānta iṣṭa. In old age grandfather likes solitude."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Chosen quiet; ಒಂಟಿತನ is loneliness you did not choose."
            }
          ]
        },
